cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Muay Thai — the eight limbs, the thirty named techniques, and the gyms on the map"
message: "If you use this dataset, cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "NaN"
  - name: "Hongdam"
    city: "Chiang Rai"
    country: TH
    website: "https://hongdam.net/"
url: "https://motdang.net/muaythai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NaNoBotCo/muay-thai"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English and Thai) reference for muay thai: the eight weapons, the thirty
  named techniques of the mae mai and luk mai with what the names point at, the four
  regional schools, the ceremony and the yant that go with it, the Lanna material the
  Thai-language history starts from, and a census of every place to train that
  OpenStreetMap holds. Every claim carries a provenance tier; every figure is computed at
  build time from the files in the repository.
